Note: it is also grammatical to say {la PA la .aleksander. noi banli} as per [http://lojban.github.com/cll/6/9/index.html|Chapter 6 Section 9|whatisarelation], which gives as the name {la .aleksander. noi banli}, not {me la .aleksander. noi banli} (though a reasonable audience would probably ignore the {me} part of the name), and does not imply that there is something called {aleksander} (though, again, a reasonable audience would understand).